-- 141: 80s POP MINING -> SOLO -> HARD TECHNO -> PRETTY RETURN.
-- Session arc, all on one take (recordings/jam-20261004-1103.wav):
--   1. 120 BPM groove with hooks mined from ~/tunepile (index/tunepile.db, FTS5).
--   2. Kick became "x x - - x x x - -" (9 steps); everything reworked around it.
--   3. Kick + clap dropped; then all parts except the melody dropped for a solo.
--   4. Melody extended to an 8-bar arc, big regular dub delay + big verb, chopped.
--   5. A new hard techno beat + rolling bass dropped in under it.
--   6. Techno out; back to something pretty — a second Tunepile hook (Toto,
--      "Africa") with the F#m pad restored. This file reflects the final state.
-- Melody (d6) — Toto, "Africa" (1982), chorus line:
--   tabs-tidal/Toto_-_Africa.gp3-*.tidal — indexed run b4 e5 cs5 e5 b4 e5 …
--   Recast to an 8-bar A-major phrase set: statement, rise (fs5), high (gs5),
--   return. All pitches in A major / F#m (a b cs e fs gs) — stays in key.
--   gain slow 16 (0.55..0.9 saw); dub delay ddSend 0.35, delaytime 3/8,
--   feedback 0.45, lock 1; verbSend 0.45, size 0.9, room 0.7, verbT60 5.
--   (The earlier a-ha "Take On Me" solo + chop and the hard techno are gone.)
-- Pad (d11) — vi-IV-I-V in F#m (Tunepile chords/progressions), hoRhodes,
--   soft gain 0.34, verbSend 0.3.
-- Drum/other streams silent. Hooks used earlier in the session, now silent:
--   arpeggio (Tears For Fears "Everybody Wants To Rule The World"),
--   bass ("Billie Jean" contour), pad (F#m), hard techno beat/rolling bass.
-- Sources: Dirt-Samples + dubsynth, hoRhodes (project DSP).
-- Mix: per-stream gain deliberate, master UNITY as in 139/140.
setcps 0.5

d1 $ silence

d2 $ silence

d3 $ silence

d4 $ silence

d5 $ silence

d6 $ slow 2 $ note "<[b4 e5 cs5 e5 b4 e5 cs5 b4 e5 cs5 b4 a4 gs4 a4 ~] [cs5 e5 fs5 e5 cs5 e5 fs5 e5 a4 b4 cs5 e5 b4 cs5 b4 ~] [e5 fs5 gs5 fs5 e5 cs5 b4 cs5 e5 fs5 e5 cs5 b4 a4 gs4 ~] [b4 e5 cs5 e5 b4 e5 cs5 b4 e5 cs5 b4 a4 ~ ~ ~ ~]>" # s "hoRhodes" # gain (slow 16 $ range 0.55 0.9 saw) # cutoff 3600 # release 0.6 # ddSend 0.35 # lock 1 # delaytime (3/8) # delayfeedback 0.45 # verbSend 0.45 # size 0.9 # room 0.7 # verbT60 5 # verbDamp 0.4

d7 $ silence

d8 $ silence

d9 $ silence

d10 $ silence

d11 $ slow 2 $ n "<[fs3,a3,cs4] [d3,fs3,a3] [a2,cs3,e3] [e3,gs3,b3]>" # s "hoRhodes" # gain 0.34 # cutoff 2200 # release 0.7 # verbSend 0.3

d12 $ silence
